	(text "Shiftreg clocks buffer.\n- DIR=1 (A->B), powered from Vcca (3.3V)\n- Acts as a clock fanout to avoid excessive load on the clock lines (1 dedicated shiftreg clock per plane).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.53 133.096 0)
